{"version":1,"content":"<p>Anthropic 已正式啓動首次公開募股（IPO）的投資者路演。公司計劃發行 8.25 億股股票，每股發行價區間為 70 至 78 美元，最高募資規模可達 643.5 億美元。若按區間上限定價，其完全稀釋估值將接近 1.4 萬億美元，這將是人工智能行業迄今規模最大的上市交易之一。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585834.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T17:24:28.526680+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T16:59:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T17:17:46.380544+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T17:17:46.380544+00:00","content_hash":"38773d05dc89763b540e3d92439733550f4abfa83371a6234bf414dae3865461","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}